    {
      "id": "s-6575475c84821e1b",
      "kind": "release",
      "title": "Release v2.7.2 🌈",
      "url": "https://github.com/appsmithorg/appsmith/releases/tag/v2.7.2",
      "collected_at": "2026-11-21T07:31:02+00:00",
      "published_at": "2026-11-19T16:23:11Z",
      "text": "## 🔐 Security\r\n\r\n- The bundled Java runtime is now Eclipse Temurin 25.0.5.1. This fixes [CVE-2026-114938](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-114938) (\"Java4Shell\") in the Java runtime. All earlier Appsmith images include an affected Java version. Self-hosted instances shou",
      "links": [],
      "metadata": {
        "tag": "v2.7.2",
        "prerelease": false,
        "public_excerpt": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-066a5fe70e89fbef",
      "kind": "release",
      "title": "Release v2.7.1 🌈",
      "url": "https://github.com/appsmithorg/appsmith/releases/tag/v2.7.1",
      "collected_at": "2026-11-21T07:31:02+00:00",
      "published_at": "2026-11-18T15:11:01Z",
      "text": "## ⚠️ Important Upgrade Notes\r\n\r\n- **Embed allowlist:** `APPSMITH_ALLOWED_FRAME_ANCESTORS` must be a list of CSP `frame-ancestors` source expressions. A saved value that is not in that form is served as `'self'` after the next restart. Saving the setting rejects an invalid value.",
      "links": [],
      "metadata": {
        "tag": "v2.7.1",
        "prerelease": false,
        "public_excerpt": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-bffecde82380f7ba",
      "kind": "release",
      "title": "Release v2.7.0 🌈",
      "url": "https://github.com/appsmithorg/appsmith/releases/tag/v2.7.0",
      "collected_at": "2026-11-21T07:31:02+00:00",
      "published_at": "2026-11-12T17:45:16Z",
      "text": "## ⚠️ Important Upgrade Notes\r\n\r\n- Helm chart: if you set some `probes` keys, the keys you did not set now take the new defaults (10 s period, 5 s timeout). If you tuned `failureThreshold` for the old 60 s period, also set `periodSeconds: 60`. Probe values that are not positive i",
      "links": [],
      "metadata": {
        "tag": "v2.7.0",
        "prerelease": false,
        "public_excerpt": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-798f77d39df5753b",
      "kind": "release",
      "title": "Release v2.6.0 🌈",
      "url": "https://github.com/appsmithorg/appsmith/releases/tag/v2.6.0",
      "collected_at": "2026-11-21T07:31:02+00:00",
      "published_at": "2026-10-28T18:10:23Z",
      "text": "## ⚠️ For EE users, before upgrading to v2.6.0 finish existing Temporal workflow runs on v2.5.1\r\n\r\nAppsmith is moving to a new workflow engine. Runs that started on the old Temporal engine cannot be relied on to resume or finish after upgrading to v2.6.0.\r\n\r\nA **run** is one exec",
      "links": [],
      "metadata": {
        "tag": "v2.6.0",
        "prerelease": false,
        "public_excerpt": true
      }
    }
