  "translations": {
    "## ⚠️ For EE users, before upgrading to v2.6.0 finish existing Temporal workflow runs on v2.5.1 Appsmith is moving to a new workflow engine. Runs that started on the old Temporal engine cannot be relied on to resume or finish after upgrading to v2.6.0. A **run** is one execution of a workflow. This includes executions waiting fo": "发布说明摘译：企业版用户升级 v2.6.0 前，应先在 v2.5.1 完成已有 Temporal 工作流执行。项目正迁移到新工作流引擎，旧引擎启动的执行在升级后不能保证恢复或完成，后续说明被截断。",
    "## ⚠️ Important Upgrade Notes - **Embed allowlist:** `APPSMITH_ALLOWED_FRAME_ANCESTORS` must be a list of CSP `frame-ancestors` source expressions. A saved value that is not in that form is served as `'self'` after the next restart. Saving the setting rejects an invalid value. (#42622) - **Git page names:** Git will not commit a": "发布说明摘译：APPSMITH_ALLOWED_FRAME_ANCESTORS 必须由 CSP frame-ancestors 来源表达式组成；不符合格式的已有值在重启后按 self 处理，保存时拒绝无效值（#42622）。下一项 Git 页面名称说明被截断。",
    "## ⚠️ Important Upgrade Notes - Helm chart: if you set some `probes` keys, the keys you did not set now take the new defaults (10 s period, 5 s timeout). If you tuned `failureThreshold` for the old 60 s period, also set `periodSeconds: 60`. Probe values that are not positive integers now fail `helm install` and `helm upgrade`. Q": "发布说明摘译：Helm chart 未显式设置的 probes 配置使用新默认值：周期 10 秒、超时 5 秒。若 failureThreshold 按旧的 60 秒周期调整，还应设置 periodSeconds: 60。非正整数的探针配置会导致 helm install 或 helm upgrade 失败。",
    "## 🔐 Security - The bundled Java runtime is now Eclipse Temurin 25.0.5.1. This fixes CVE-2026-114938 (\"Java4Shell\") in the Java runtime. All earlier Appsmith images include an affected Java version. Self-hosted instances should upgrade.": "发布说明摘译：捆绑的 Java 运行环境升级为 Eclipse Temurin 25.0.5.1。发布说明称其修复 CVE-2026-114938（Java4Shell），并称早期 Appsmith 镜像包含受影响版本，建议自托管实例升级。以上为来源发布说明的表述。",
    "Appsmith Blog | Open-Source Low-Code Platform for Internal Tools": "Appsmith 博客与内容",
    "Appsmith pricing - simple, user-based pricing": "Appsmith 定价与方案",
    "Appsmith | Open-Source Low-Code Application Platform": "Appsmith 官网",
    "README 内容摘录：--- Organizations build custom applications like dashboards, admin panels, customer 360, IT automation, and service management tools to help their teams work more efficiently and effectively. Appsmith is an open-source low-code pl": "README 摘录（中文）：企业可构建仪表盘、管理后台、客户全景视图、IT 自动化和服务管理等定制应用，提升团队效率。Appsmith 是开源低代码平台，摘录在此被截断。",
